# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Herbalism 50-100
section Herbalism 50-100

step Journeyman Herbalism
  tip Journeyman Herbalism raises the cap to 150; it needs skill 50 and no character level, and costs 5s: train it as soon as you reach 50. The arrow picks the nearest Herbalism trainer of your faction. Incense Candle, Forever's camping item for Herbalism, is taught from skill 20 (1s, or free from Camping 101: Herbalism): a Peacebloom and a Silverleaf each, it gives points until 25; placed beside a campfire it gives everyone at the camp a buff for an hour.
  train Herbalism Journeyman
  learn 1229705

step Mageroyal (50-70)
  tip Walk the loop and pick every Peacebloom (1, yellow, rare), Silverleaf (1, yellow), Stunted Silverleaf (1, yellow), Wilted Peacebloom (1, yellow), Earthroot (15, yellow), Mageroyal (50, orange) on the way until Herbalism 70. Mageroyal and Briarthorn sometimes give a Swiftthistle as well. The Elwynn Forest, Tirisfal Glades loops have no Mageroyal, so fewer points a lap: worth it only when the zone suits your level better. A quest in these zones needs Herbalism: Root Samples (level 16, Mebok Mizzyrix, The Barrens). The arrow takes the loop that gets you there soonest from where you are and walks it until the skill is reached; each loop keeps to creatures no more than a level above you and away from the other faction's towns, and the window names it and its lap. Expect about 50 herbs for these 20 points: about 35 Silverleaf, 20 Mageroyal, 10 Peacebloom, 10 Earthroot and 5 Swiftthistle. For Alchemy: about 85 Silverleaf, 50 Mageroyal, 110 Peacebloom and 45 Earthroot in all.
