  tip Walk the loop and pick every Goldthorn (170, green), Khadgar's Whisker (185, green), Firebloom (205, green, rare), Purple Lotus (210, green), Sungrass (230, yellow), Blindweed (235, yellow), Ghost Mushroom (245, orange), Gromsblood (250, orange), Golden Sansam (260, orange) on the way until Herbalism 285. Ghost Mushroom grows in caves and dark hollows: look inside as well. Purple Lotus sometimes gives a Wildvine as well. Gromsblood grows near demon and satyr camps: pull carefully. The Swamp of Sorrows, Desolace, Blasted Lands loops have no Ghost Mushroom, so fewer points a lap: worth it only when the zone suits your level better. The The Hinterlands, Swamp of Sorrows loops have no Gromsblood, so fewer points a lap: worth it only when the zone suits your level better. The Swamp of Sorrows, Desolace, Blasted Lands loops have no Golden Sansam, so fewer points a lap: worth it only when the zone suits your level better. The arrow takes the loop that gets you there soonest from where you are and walks it until the skill is reached; each loop keeps to creatures no more than a level above you and away from the other faction's towns, and the window names it and its lap. Expect about 50 herbs for these 25 points: about 20 Blindweed, 20 Sungrass, 10 Purple Lotus, 10 Khadgar's Whisker, 5 Goldthorn, 5 Golden Sansam, 5 Firebloom, 5 Ghost Mushroom and 5 Stranglevine. For Alchemy: about 50 Sungrass, 145 Purple Lotus and 45 Goldthorn in all.
